  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- Tool titles: every generated tool has a human-readable title, sent as annotations.title, which clients show in place of the tool name (a connector directory listing, the prompt to approve a call). It is derived from the action name, so LogWorkout becomes \"Log workout\", or from the action part of a custom ToolName. [McpExpose(Title = \"...\")] on an action sets it explicitly.\n\nChanged:\n- Clients that show titles now list each generated tool by its title instead of its name. The tool names themselves are unchanged.",
